<Base title="Saltmarsh Bakehouse | Slow sourdough by the sea" description="Saltmarsh Bakehouse is an invented bakery that bakes slowly, in a hot oven, before the sun comes up.">
  <h1>Sourdough, baked slowly by the sea</h1>
  <p class="lede">Everything below is a plain image tag pointing at a file in the public folder. The browser gets the full file every time.</p>

  <img class="hero-img" src="/hero.jpg" alt="Warm illustration of a sunrise over rolling hills, the colours of a freshly baked crust" />

  <figure class="photo">
    <img class="photo-img" src="/ovens.jpg" alt="Illustration of the bakehouse ovens glowing at dawn" />
    <figcaption>The ovens are lit at 3am.</figcaption>
  </figure>
</Base>
